message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Chansonia — a lyrics-synchronised player for «La lampe, le fleuve et les couleurs»"
abstract: >-
  A lyrics-synchronised music player for the album «La lampe, le fleuve et les
  couleurs», a six-track mini song-cycle by Je m'appelle Hương. One codebase
  ships as a web app, an Android app and an iOS app; the interface follows the
  songbook page of the author's academic homepage.
